      "main_details": "<ul>\n<li><strong>Firearm Form o 【HR + 10】</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Accurate</strong></p>\n<p>Adds a +2 bonus to the weapon&rsquo;s Accuracy Check formula.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Powerful </strong>⭐</p>\n<p>The weapon deals 5 extra damage</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Transforming</strong></p>\n<p>Transform into the Dagger-type melee weapon</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Blade Form【HR + 5】</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Accurate</strong></p>\n<p>Adds a +2 bonus to the weapon&rsquo;s Accuracy Check formula.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Defense Boost</strong></p>\n<p>You gain a +2 bonus to Defense, and you are treated as having a shield equipped for<br>the sake of your Skills</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Transforming</strong></p>\n<p>Transform into the Firearm-type Range weapon</p>",
      "main_hand": "Sidewinder",
      "main_hand_attack": "",
      "max_hp": "478",
      "max_ip": "12",
      "max_mp": "55",
      "max_zero": "6",
      "mig_base": "6",
      "mig_current": 6,
      "name": "⭐ Fortune, the Dark Merchant",
      "notes_text": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Calm yet calculated</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Despite her calm and gentle demeanor, she is without a doubt, a strict businesswoman. She Navigate the world of business under a facade of kindness and occasional playfulness, while maintaining a cold and efficient demeanor when it comes to her dealing.</p>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Life of Luxuries</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Beyond her business dealing, Lucrétia lives a life of opulence and sophistication. She do enjoys indulging herself in the pleasure of a good foods or accomodations. She likes collecting Fine Arts and would also loan them to museums.</p>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Appreciation of Arts</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Lucrétia is an avid enjoyers of fine arts, Like most refined lady, she enjoys the beauty of arts, but even more beyond its beauty, &nbsp;Lucrétia is more captivated by the message and personality of the artist bleeding through each masterpiece, these thoughts are what keeping her mind pondering, a sentiments which she enjoys</p>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Fame, the crow</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Fame is a crow that Lucrétia trained to act as her messenger.</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>",
