          "details": "<p>Set a Trap for certains specific actions. Secretly choose between <strong>【Attack】【Skill】</strong>or<strong>【Spell】.&nbsp;</strong>As long as this trap is active, when an enemy perform the same type of action that you choose, They takes 20 Physical damage and suffers a debuff depending on which type of trap, then deactivates this trap.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>【Attack】＝</strong>Frightened</p>\n<p><strong>【Skill】＝</strong>Paralyzed</p>\n<p><strong>【Spell】＝</strong>Silence</p>\n<hr>\n<p>You may only have one active trap at the same time. If you put a new one down, the old one becomes deactivates.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "other_name": "Set Trap",
          "roll": ""
        },
